version_and_eligibility:pass(`The cited version is specifically the 50-page author manuscript FoCM-3.pdf, so its Lemma 7.2 numbering is appropriate. Its title, content, pagination and PDF hash ${lsha} match the selected edition. Independent publisher read on 2026-11-03 identifies DOI 10.1007/s10208-025-09702-0, published/version of record 4 March 2025, issue June 2026; no correction/withdrawal notice appeared on the inspected article page (HTML SHA256 8db01447487109138afca334eacf14055ccda60732d95066758e314f3a90c63d). The paywalled journal text was not substituted for the available original manuscript. This independent bilinear estimate is an eligible published-article manuscript result, not the target or the source numerical convergence theorem.`,["problem.md:821-824",`${lw}:1-28`,`${lw}:3877-4130`,"source-942156739660edbdf9e8ff36bee3551db77c84ede95934ac57912a8813195ea0.txt:4-22","external-source-evidence.json#/E003/source_contract/version"])
